    <forecast>
        <area aac="SA_FA001" description="South Australia" type="region">
            <forecast-period start-time-local="2026-11-20T21:18:56+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-20T21:18:56+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-20T10:48:56Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-20T10:48:56Z">
                <text type="warning_summary_footer">For latest warnings go to www.bom.gov.au, subscribe to RSS feeds, call 1300 659 210* or listen for warnings on relevant TV and radio broadcasts.</text>
                <text type="synoptic_situation">A low pressure trough about eastern South Australia moves east to clear the state Friday evening. A weak high pressure system about the west moves across the state on Saturday. A trough of low pressure and cold front move into the west late Saturday evening and cross the remainder of of South Australia on Sunday. Another cold front clips the southeast on Monday, followed by a high pressure system, which will then move across southern parts of the state on Tuesday.</text>
                <text type="product_footer">* Calls to 1300 numbers cost around 27.5c incl. GST, higher from mobiles or public phones.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
        <area aac="SA_PW014" description="North East Pastoral" type="public-district" parent-aac="SA_FA001">
            <forecast-period index="0" start-time-local="2026-11-20T21:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-21T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-20T10:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-20T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Clear. Winds southeast to southwesterly 15 to 25 km/h.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="1" start-time-local="2026-11-21T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-22T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-20T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-21T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Sunny morning. The chance of a thunderstorm in the far northeast in the late afternoon and evening. Winds southeast to southwesterly 15 to 25 km/h tending northeast to southeasterly in the morning then tending northwest to northeasterly in the middle of the day. Overnight temperatures falling to between 16 and 26 with daytime temperatures reaching 35 to 43.</text>
                <text type="fire_danger">Moderate</text>
                <text type="uv_alert">Sun protection 8:50am to 5:10pm, UV Index predicted to reach 12 [Extreme]</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="2" start-time-local="2026-11-22T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-23T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-21T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-22T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Slight chance of a shower south of Leigh Creek, near zero chance elsewhere. The chance of raised dust north of Leigh Creek in the morning and early afternoon. The chance of a thunderstorm in the evening. Winds northwest to northeasterly 35 to 50 km/h tending northwest to southwesterly 30 to 45 km/h in the middle of the day then tending south to southwesterly 25 to 40 km/h in the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to 22 to 29 with daytime temperatures reaching 38 to 46.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="3" start-time-local="2026-11-23T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-24T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-22T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-23T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Slight chance of a shower in the far northeast, near zero chance elsewhere. The chance of a thunderstorm east of Leigh Creek in the morning and afternoon. Winds southerly 30 to 45 km/h. Overnight temperatures falling to between 16 and 28 with daytime temperatures reaching 30 to 40.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="4" start-time-local="2026-11-24T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-25T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-23T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-24T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Mostly sunny. The chance of a thunderstorm in the far northeast in the morning and afternoon. Winds south to southeasterly 25 to 40 km/h. Overnight temperatures falling to between 11 and 24 with daytime temperatures reaching 27 to 36.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
